      "id": "q60qlcl",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "24yejz8",
      "content": "• Jim Corbett is the first national park in India."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "t3b0dfw",
      "content": "• Gir National Park is the only natural habitat of Asiatic lions."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "o11yyin",
      "content": "• Kaziranga National Park is famous for one-horned rhinoceros."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cdvw7ll",
      "content": "• Hemis National Park is the largest national park in India."
    }
